      "classification": "substantive",
      "coverage": "covered",
      "text": [
        "The Problem of Overfitting",
        "• DNNs easily overfit to high dimensional data.",
        "As the dimensionality increases, # of data points (amount of information)",
        "required for good performance increases exponentially.",
        "• Hence, we inject domain-specific information to",
        "design DNNs like:",
        "• Convolutional neural networks (CNNs)",
        "• Recurrent neural networks (RNNs)",
