      "title": "Geometry",
      "classification": "substantive",
      "coverage": "covered",
      "text": [
        "Geometry",
        "• A study of invariants, i.e., properties unchanged under",
        "some class of transformations, called the symmetries.",
        "• Euclidean geometry studies lengths and angles",
        "(preserved by rotations and translations).",
        "• Affine geometry studies parallelism",
        "(preserved by affine transformations)."
